# PhotoPrism gallery

Albums are configured in `_data/galleries.yml`. Do not add per-album HTML pages.

## YAML

```yaml
groups:
  - slug: football-2627
    title: Football 26-27
    albums:
      - slug: football-4
        title: Varsity vs Opponent
        token: uniquetoken
```

- Each album needs its **own unique** share token (no share password).
- Hide with `published: false` on a group or album.
- Highlights slideshow token: `highlights.token`.
- Group buttons on `/gallery/` come from `groups` (not a separate `categories` heading).

## Pages

| URL | Role |
|---|---|
| `/gallery/` | Group buttons + highlights slideshow |
| `/gallery/group/?id=SLUG` | Albums in that group |
| `/gallery/album/?id=SLUG` | Slideshow (`id` matches **slug or token**) |

## JS

- Session: `POST {photoprism}/api/v1/session` with `{ token }`, then `X-Session-ID` only (no Bearer).
- After changing `gallery-*.js`, bump `?v=` on **all** gallery script tags together.
- Keep `window.GALLERY_ALBUMS = {{ site.data.galleries | jsonify }}` on group/album pages.

## CORS

PhotoPrism must allow `https://timberlineblazerboosters.org` and `https://timberline-blazer-boosters.github.io`.
